  122: 	/*  #515: `bus' used to be BOTH the configuration CYCLE TYPE and the
  123: 	    DESTINATION BUS, and conflating them is the whole defect.  IOC_CONF bit 0
  124: 	    selects the cycle type only -- 21066/21066A HRM S6.2.9: "PCI address bits
  125: 	    ad<1:0> come directly from configuration cycle type register (IOC_CONF,
